t","target":" ，每回合受到 %0.2f 物理伤害（随回合递增）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c4cec233fae6b60b5d7fd0513fabae06d7738e843f7075910ac0243296fccc8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"67f8f7d703154f9a58e1bc2a69b85e19a93b2500fc60e2582a5b28f244353fc9","logical_entry_identity":"714d74ae4a1e5ffa211e78f31c145416989cd3930fbbe73bf33420b6f68e7faa","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Radiant Horrorc","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"光明克星"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d9ed1a79070dd162dc94a18d5bc1d7118c19b16dfb1adafc3e6b0f51323a508c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"682517fc0b9ec175e0a0ac0caeeb706bafd445cccc811e00efd3c7b26d0ba2dc","logical_entry_identity":"fb665c47591e87784a5f9d7cf46eb22601e3ec60bed0d2fba965735eaa36fbe3","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Cloak","source_tag":"_t","target":"斗篷"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6a81f082d59dba177cdfadd74dcae5d898416bfeb91eb982be60216621eedde9","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6830281ad92b3e5ca8d83da327cfe1dfebfacecb280d9293f245c344da8a7b20","logical_entry_identity":"fe462f42be593fa578401c17f82ade4b1d72f7da533378fb1366e043119fe8ab","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Cloaking Device","source_tag":"talent name","target":"隐形装置"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc3e0d56f0f9332dd02e0b7e620e21b6129cef1426174087fe83d47d3efd52d1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"683a7987ab82cfed0b6ac25b0c970a6c5d37c485f61592aae9e6a74ae51edbf4","logical_entry_identity":"a00dc14b8789e9ec6fe4545b48ee0ec81bb74ecda66c07240fc3cc397122579f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Blood of Undeath","source_tag":"entity name","target":"不死之血"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f5b6b9d3e75b87142d0b7fabb81cd94b8a6c9853454ce10536c9dfb54ecc998c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"683f150153f6c99f0fcd98b382cc4c62ac3e1450c56cf711cb276baf0ffe7d0b","logical_entry_identity":"d57010cc4bb9a58b9bbabaaf1c6eb0c0f7f7d69d19f5bc9c22cbcb20ba80ef18","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"climb back to the ground","source_tag":"entity name","target":"爬回地面"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"11096e0db5de0fc78816c357581f03189e5dd699d8ad576f27dc32e2c8f63668","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"686505d888f1be36ddb645fabc717c396f17dbff92cd0b8f811dd3e713a95b80","logical_entry_identity":"bda05dbb8fb7d50903b5cdbe2131bf9299c4cf1a9b9203ed1ffe9bd9b81cbdb8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#{italic}#To: Guard Captain Galsamae\nFrom: Administrator Quellop#{normal}#\n\nI've requested an increase to our budget. Ten beds and eight chairs are on their way. Is there anything else you need?\n\nWith my sincerest apologies,\nAdministrator Quellop\n\n#{bold}#---#{normal}#\n\n#{italic}#To: Administrator Quellop\nFrom: Guard Captain Galsamae#{normal}#\n\nA steel hand-rail on the south staircase would be nice.\n\n-Galsamae\n\n#{bold}#---#{normal}#\n\n#{italic}#To: Guard Captain Galsamae\nFrom: Administrator Quellop#{normal}#\n\nDone.\n\n-Quellop","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#致：卫队队长加尔萨迈\n来自：管理员夸洛普#{normal}#\n\n我已经向上级申请了增加预算。很快就会运来十张新床和八把新的椅子的。请问你们还有什么需要的吗？\n\n请接受我诚挚的歉意，\n管理员夸洛普\n\n#{bold}#---#{normal}#\n\n#{italic}#致：管理员夸洛普\n来自：卫队队长加尔萨迈#{normal}#\n\n如果能给南边的楼梯增加钢质的扶手就更好了。\n\n——加尔萨迈\n\n#{bold}#---#{normal}#\n\n#{italic}#致：卫队队长加尔萨迈\n来自：管理员夸洛普#{normal}#\n\n好的，我已经办妥了。\n\n——夸洛普"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0f09f33f094569b90605720f69443cba592fb47ebe3d56560032b892844d23a3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"687c4ce90146421617ab58d8667df2733605d5e18bb3996ced5eb0e392314e17","logical_entry_identity":"84ed0df88142539d0113320d9f3d852f1156e9614da7998ff22e3fafb57007d9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"These talents focus on arcane and temporal damage, using a super-spinned steamsaw to rip holes in reality.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这一系技能专注于奥术和时空伤害，使用超高速旋转的蒸汽链锯切裂现实。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"161add896238cbebd57b6201d74350e0c52f43103789a7537989d6769dc5ea85","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6