add4c8a780039507e06761cbb3ea4ac9ee4ffd6f233d40999162f3441","logical_entry_identity":"f460c1b500431dbae17287aac320c1a416bbfc23da79446e969bb0ab87eaf1ee","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"After researching the remains of many foes you found new ways to bring the literal heat of battle to your foes!\nYou can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Annihilator class#WHITE#.\n\nAnnihilators are Tinkers that can create and use heavy weapons (flamethrowers, shockstaves, boltguns) and apply their tinkering knowledge to create advanced war contraptions.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Unleash the power of your heavy weapons\n- Construct automated turrets for war or even medical purposes\n- Build an mecharachnid bot to help you in combat that can act independently or be directly piloted\n- Make your foes suffer in many new ways: fire rockets and grenades at them, equip an exoskeleton, ... #WHITE#\n\nAll Tinker classes use Steam for their powers.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"研究过众多敌人的残骸后，你找到了把真正的“战斗之火”带给敌人的新方法！\n现在可以创建#LIGHT_GREEN#歼灭者#WHITE#职业的新角色。\n\n歼灭者是能够制造和使用重型武器（火焰喷射器、电击法杖和爆矢枪）的工匠，还能运用工艺知识创造先进的战争装置。\n职业特色：#YELLOW#\n- 释放重型武器的威力\n- 建造用于战斗甚至医疗的自动炮台\n- 制造机械蜘蛛机器人协助战斗；它既可自主行动，也可由你直接驾驶\n- 用种种新手段折磨敌人：向他们发射火箭和手榴弹、装备外骨骼……#WHITE#\n\n所有工匠职业都以蒸汽驱动能力。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b1e22f235e36827de2430f73413c7c4ee61e12783528c8b2cb6948e5904d17c0","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b1b423f0594cb770f61c096c2afe0951ac934e9ee5776cb20fad3e18fcde9a4","logical_entry_identity":"0135824582c182ed3c4c17b72ede0b9b66b0e542f4eefefe922d2b2879a8546b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Sook's Runes and other Harmless Contraptions","source_tag":"entity name","target":"苏克的符文与其他无害小玩意"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cccf42e5da7ca5f35d1107c4ce9ba11b4fc2792b038bde4bcc93edfbdb046cad","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b21f849b776cb23c1cd0c3ec8d337f43fa8013046cdcd2aa2f0b2a97b9e2e7e","logical_entry_identity":"31a827b6a1e0d223b04f99dfd3280f09019d097c6fd2637c63d665e51ece7ac0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Corrosive Flechette","source_tag":"_t","target":"腐蚀性毒镖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2957146903cbf0f2b9c738f4aebd773ad4dae687472792bb174209dc6c2b57f8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b30151f956e66b7cc54f5be0b5d0531da807e55a101a77930b18fb39987e003","logical_entry_identity":"7aecd1c6efd1d4ea443175cd392c2286be23c83cadeba14c0666a16f9965145b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Any time you deal damage with a psionic ability you incur a negative biofeedback in your foes, stacking up to %d times for 5 turns.\n\t\tEach stack reduces their physical save by %d, defense and armour by %d.\n\t\tThis effect may only occur once per turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当你使用精神技能造成伤害时，你对你的敌人施加一个负反馈，能叠加至 %d 层并持续 5 回合。\n\t\t每层都会降低他们 %d 的物理豁免和 %d 的防御与护甲。\n\t\t这个效果每回合只能触发一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bfd46e2f3d873b0198d43346dc6fcab423ce0821195041d96a9d90c10909b10e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b3d22b8ec508b234b08b8847108d6f2d438ed5723d27829bf2e4f7fff91cf0b","logical_entry_identity":"48fb4227415ffb206cf5d9253b9ecfba4bb21e6eddc211f7623aafe86cf921c9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"a telepathic message <Rough Drafts>","source_tag":"_t","target":"心灵传讯《粗略的草稿》"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ab4f5b57c41c5713231ee73f36cc1b1ea6865c3cfdca4e8f558ca9d7b9b775de","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b539b16f2612d3a3d474b26348cdf5567f34bc293db31d4787ec968d2dd4d50","logical_entry_identity":"0b278a04f10e02c915ba27e51222887bfc7c999715629e48653f5ce5e25a728a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Crushed High Sun Paladin Aeryn and with her destroyed the bastion of the Sunwall.","source_tag":"_t","target":"杀死高阶太阳骑士艾琳，并摧毁晨曦之门。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"65c1924244f64522c6715d9ecbacaefef2b41b77be210d45dfc224ee4c09c5c3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b5bfe8e2cb0f2921ea82a0c9d734c657f07f82e8f9b4ef6c0ac7c20bd7c855a","logical_entry_identity":"d2ef31590350b76761b9218c9dc04612edf5e67da832936bedbdeed095a561c2","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"sapphire","source_tag":"_t","target":"蓝宝石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eaa98bf4ca145b3d7b897930ed07f849cb0d9894d4534e50df2be331b3d1ee8e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b68997fd9e0a598196fc055b2937b195d79cbcf4d2bc239bc0b30989dc921cb","logical_entry_identity":"3cd0ffa73d842946c47792ffa893422ebb1f3d55a43c1397bf5339e90677d251","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Spin your saw at incredible speeds for an instant, fully breaking reality in a 3-wide beam in front of you.\n\t\tAny creatures caught by the beam take %0.2f occult damage and are untethered from reality, reducing their global speed by %d%% and the speed of any projectiles they fire by %d%% for 4 turns.\n\t\tAt level 3 any projectiles caught in the beam are instantly annihilated.\n\t\tAt level 5 the beam is so strong that all creatures caught inside are knocked back 3 tiles.\n\t\tThe breach is so deep that the beam will always have the maximum possible length it can.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"让你的链锯以难以置信的速度飞速旋转，撕裂周围的现实，在你面前产生一条宽度为 3 的射线。\n\t\t所有被射线击中的生物将会受到 %0.2f 玄机伤害，并且进入脱离现实的状态。它们的整体速度降低 %d%%，发射的一切抛射物也会被减速 %d%%，持续 4 回合。\n\t\t技能等级 3 时，射线范围内的所有抛射物也会被立刻摧毁。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时，这一射线的力量是如此强大，所有被击中的生物都会被击退 3 码。\n\t\t这道裂隙是如此之深，射线总会延伸至其可能达到的最大长度。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fb2fa5791d08be4bf56b8fd6274c0389f88d486547eca488e3f54d81415e261f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b6f36181ed352256441405c0398a4c7f2c180191be5dd050c14fad6a59a085c","logical_entry_identity":"8882e696fb7dbd798baa113ae4ceeb4d47bf1d1880242c745a0f8b38d1a22987","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"I... am %s, of the seed of Garkul the Devourer. Garkul taught us to fight legends, and to flinch not from even the most desperate deed. Here and now I face you without fear or hesitation, for the spirit of Garkul burns within me. And in his name I will #{bold}#break#{normal}# you!","source_tag":"tformat","target":"我……名为%s，是吞噬者加库尔的后裔。加库尔教导我们挑战传奇，面对绝境也绝不退缩。此时此刻，我毫无畏惧与迟疑地面对你，因加库尔之意志在我体内燃烧。以他之名，我必将#{bold}#击垮#{normal}#你！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aaa907f4c65cbb37d74228be7b465c0bf372851caa7555aa4a0cc7dad38201ff","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b77b8adb3f7e0b559c5d5637ac2359fa8560e3ad0933fc2fa8a9d8f2f4f1b18","logical_entry_identity":"38c3ba3be6ff958475c9f08e346d73b6d66780aeb812bc646b5cec24b1da079a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"frost","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"冰冻"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"59ca58a61eef297339f7359c7d952f32dc78359fe42a918408ebfdd9c54931f6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b8091680a7207014a1cfd8a3c180f6eeba82c01578a5204910d6b530f7a22b8","logical_entry_identity":"92faaa1f5b2f2dea9deba8ddecf9ef018bc8f328a2a9f20c4f1ca1d51d7d39a0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"-Vamp Surge","source_tag":"_t","target":"-吸血狂潮"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a819723a9bcf98a824a5050de50a7a0ad937b9107f349cd182aa067d210dce31","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6b834304f072aa4dae48214b4d4398439698329ed6be14d25795083f0c593e02","logical_entry_identity":"83cb963006c85d0fc689f9e0e10bcbe94e2d9565c66ec1a49a21917a7e1f6f9e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Mana Coil","source_tag":"_t","target":"魔力线圈"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea7fddb72226cd601cd53ad0e43d753849d971f12cbfcbe2bda0b2849e636655","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6ba0b66d64f70ef807a8a9fa76b0eb795d74275adb376756c88caf989bc31ab6","logical_entry_identity":"2624c5d1830cf125c0496f52cf025a03a96ca78d426cbb0993533d19bfb1b2f5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"inject yourself with painkillers, reducing all incoming damage by 5. Stacks up to 5 times. When the effect ends, lose 5% of your max life per stack","source_tag":"_t","target":"为自己注射镇痛剂，使受到的所有伤害降低 5 点。最多叠加 5 次。效果结束时，每层使你损失 5% 最大生命值。"},{"args_or